id: DRAFT-gpgme-1-24-0-1-multi-binding-relocatable-cmake-config
draft: true
contributor_id: zxyAtom
title: GPGME multi-binding package exports relocatable CMake configs after DESTDIR installation
trigger_tool: cmake
phase: package
error_signature: (gpgmeConfig|GpgmeppConfig|QGpgmeQt6Config).*(/lib|/include|NOTFOUND)
severity: high
category: conan,autotools,cmake,relocatability
match_keywords: gpgme,Gpgmepp,QGpgmeQt6,DESTDIR,CMAKE_CURRENT_LIST_DIR,find_package
root_cause: Upstream GPGME CMake package metadata retains /lib and /include after DESTDIR installation, so consumers need package-local configs whose import locations are derived from CMAKE_CURRENT_LIST_DIR.
affected_scope: gpgme/1.24.0.1 on OHOS aarch64 with libgpg-error/1.55, libassuan/3.0.2, and qtbase-sql-dbus/6.11.1 when C, GpgME++, and Qt6 bindings are consumed through CMake.
verification_cmd: conan create archives/g/gpgme/1.24.0.1 -pr:h=<ohos-aarch64> -pr:b=<ohos-aarch64> --build="gpgme/*"
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: package_local_relocatable_cmake_configs
rec_description: Generate gpgme, Gpgmepp, and QGpgmeQt6 configs under lib/cmake, derive the package prefix from CMAKE_CURRENT_LIST_DIR, and preserve the C to C++ to Qt6 target dependency chain.
rec_command:
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: manual
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach:
fallback_description: No independently verified fallback; do not retain upstream absolute install paths.
fallback_command:
fallback_auto_fix: false
fallback_impl:
forbid_1_pattern: hardcode_build_or_DESTDIR_paths_in_imported_targets
forbid_1_reason: Build-folder and DESTDIR paths are not part of the installed package contract and become invalid after package relocation.
forbid_1_consequence: CMake find_package may succeed while the imported target points to missing libraries or headers.
principles:
causes:
caused_by:
similar_to: E433,E435
conflicts_with:
prerequisite_of:
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-gpgme-1-24-0-1-multi-binding-relocatable-cmake-config.md
last_updated: 2026-09-06
source_event: gpgme/1.24.0.1 dependency-library PR #7424; archives/g/gpgme/1.24.0.1/reports/knowledge-evidence.md
authors: zxyAtom
